    screen: { present: true, short: '2.95" touch + 5.76M EVF', size: 2.95, res: 2333, touch: true, liveView: true, note: 'Built-in 5.76M-dot OLED EVF, 0.76x, 60 fps, -4 to +2 diopter, eye sensor. Reviewers call the 60 fps refresh laggy and muddy in low light next to the Q3. Gorilla Glass rear screen.' },
